//github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#discussion_r3831870381\",\n      \"title\": \"P2: When a collection uses numeric key `0` as the anchor, this truthiness check discards it and shift-selecting starts at `toKey`, selecting only the target instead of the full range. Check the anchor against `null` expl\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"uifn/core/src/algorithms/selection.ts\",\n      \"resolved\": false,\n      \"author\": \"cubic-dev-ai\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-21T16:19:45Z\",\n      \"outdated\": false,\n      \"line\": 68,\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#discussion_r3831870408\",\n      \"title\": \"P2: When `toKey` is not in the collection, this branch still computes a range with `indexOf(toKey) === -1` and returns a selection whose `currentKey` is missing, potentially clearing the current selection. Validate membe\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"uifn/core/src/algorithms/locale.ts\",\n      \"resolved\": false,\n      \"author\": \"cubic-dev-ai\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-21T16:19:45Z\",\n      \"outdated\": true,\n      \"line\": null,\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#discussion_r3831870412\",\n      \"title\": \"P2: When collation-equivalent text uses combining marks or expansions, `startsWith` and `includes` slice by code-point count and compare the wrong window. Match over collation-element boundaries or candidate string bound\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"uifn/core/src/algorithms/color.ts\",\n      \"resolved\": false,\n      \"author\": \"cubic-dev-ai\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-21T16:19:45Z\",\n      \"outdated\": true,\n      \"line\": null,\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#discussion_r3831870420\",\n      \"title\": \"P2: When a malformed numeric token reaches `parseUIFnColor`, the regex matches it and the parser stores `NaN` in the color, producing invalid serialized values. Use a strict CSS-number pattern and reject non-finite parse\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"uifn/components/src/contracts.ts\",\n      \"resolved\": false,\n      \"author\": \"cubic-dev-ai\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-21T16:19:45Z\",\n      \"outdated\": true,\n      \"line\": null,\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#discussion_r3831870440\",\n      \"title\": \"P2: Checkbox indeterminate state is not representable with this contract: the type accepts `mixed` but rejects canonical `indeterminate`, while the recipe emits the value unchanged and the stylesheet targets `data-state=\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"uifn/core/src/algorithms/range.ts\",\n      \"resolved\": false,\n      \"author\": \"cubic-dev-ai\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-21T16:19:45Z\",\n      \"outdated\": true,\n      \"line\": null,\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#discussion_r3831870453\",\n      \"title\": \"P2: When a range step uses scientific notation with a fractional mantissa, `decimals` undercounts its precision and `alignRangeValue` changes valid step values. Compute decimal precision from both the mantissa and expone\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"uifn/core/src/algorithms/range.ts\",\n      \"resolved\": false,\n      \"author\": \"cubic-dev-ai\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-21T16:19:45Z\",\n      \"outdated\": true,\n      \"line\": null,\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#discussion_r3831870474\",\n      \"title\": \"P2: When `step` is `NaN` or `Infinity`, this guard accepts it and `alignRangeValue` publishes `NaN`. Reject non-finite steps before calculating the aligned value.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"uifn/core/src/algorithms/async-list.ts\",\n      \"resolved\": false,\n      \"author\": \"cubic-dev-ai\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-21T16:19:45Z\",\n      \"outdated\": true,\n      \"line\": null,\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#discussio