es** since the prior Pullfrog review at `16a31f1`:\\n\\n- **Reserved HostFn attachment identities** — added atomic cross-instance domain claims, retry convergence, and provider-not-found variable deletion reconciliation.\\n- **Hardened JSON validation** — switched structural object ordering to code-unit comparison and rejected unsupported values during `uniqueItems` validation.\\n- **Preserved action-form intersections** — retained repeated property constraints from every `allOf` branch and applied nested validation to primitive fields.\\n- **Prepared confirmation activation** — durably bound staged tokens to their future success-audit IDs and documented post-interruption reconciliation.\\n\\n\\u003c!--\\nPullfrog review metadata. These findings were written against afb902d;\\nif commits have landed on SFNS-2 since, treat every specific bug, file, or\\nline callout as POTENTIALLY STALE and re-diff before acting on it.\\n\\n- Mode: IncrementalReview (delta against prior pullfrog review)\\n- Files reviewed: 1801\\n- Commits reviewed: 30\\n- Base: dev (72aabce)\\n- Head: SFNS-2 (afb902d)\\n- Reviewed commits:\\n  - afb902d — fix: close current PR review gaps\\n  - 16a31f1 — fix: address latest PR review findings\\n  - db08968 — fix: close reconciliation review gaps\\n  - 73485e8 — fix: reconcile pending admin side effects\\n  - fbb3868 — fix: resolve single-pass PR review findings\\n  - 9cf9e61 — fix: close single-pass review findings\\n  - 966f314 — fix: resolve final admin review round\\n  - b1157c7 — fix: resolve latest admin review findings\\n  - 09ff931 — fix: close post-push admin review gaps\\n  - e3e7054 — fix: harden final admin review edges\\n  - a3a6f63 — fix: resolve final console review findings\\n  - 9bd82d2 — fix: canonicalize MCP cursor identity\\n  - 358c4d2 — fix: close final PR review gaps\\n  - c6aea5c — fix: preserve Svelte controller prop routing\\n  - b2718e4 — fix: address final refetched review findings\\n  - 5e968d7 — refactor: keep cursor ide