ription-plans#what-you%E2%80%99ll-see-when-reviews-are-paused)\\n\\n\\n**On a Teams plan?**\\nReviews resume once this user has a paid seat *and* their Git account is linked in Qodo.\\n[Link Git account →](https://docs.qodo.ai/subscription-plans#linking-a-git-account)\\n\\n**Using GitHub Enterprise Server, GitLab Self-Managed, or Bitbucket Data Center?**\\nThese require an Enterprise plan - Contact us\\n[Contact us →](https://docs.qodo.ai/qodo-support#support)\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-21T15:56:25Z\",\"id\":\"IC_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABQDVEDA\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#issuecomment-5372199948\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":false},{\"author\":{\"login\":\"linear-code\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"CONTRIBUTOR\",\"body\":\"\\u003c!-- linear-linkback --\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003ca href=\\\"https://linear.app/21n/issue/SFNS-2\\\"\\u003eSFNS-2\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-21T15:56:23Z\",\"id\":\"IC_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABQDVDBA\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#issuecomment-5372199684\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":false}],\"headRefName\":\"SFNS-2\",\"headRefOid\":\"afb902dad102723f1e79c3c3cc51075aa88524dc\",\"reviews\":[{\"author\":{\"login\":\"cubic-dev-ai\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"NONE\",\"body\":\"\\u003c!-- cubic:review-summary:start --\\u003e\\n**2 issues found across 11 files (changes from recent commits).**\\n\\u003c!-- cubic:review-summary:end --\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003cdetails\\u003e\\n\\u003csummary\\u003ePrompt for AI agents (unresolved issues)\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\n```text\\n\\nCheck if these issues are valid — if so, understand the root cause of each and fix them. If appropriate, use sub-agents to investigate and fix each issue separately.\\n\\n\\n\\u003cfile name=\\\"superconsole/src/lib/server/super-console.ts\\\"\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003cviolation number=\\\"1\\\" location=\\\"superconsole/src/lib/server/super-console.ts:1089\\\"\\u003e\\nP2: When `prepareActivation` fails and the denied audit write also fails, this await escapes and the endpoint returns a generic 500 instead of the retryable 503 used for other confirmation audit failures. Wrap this denied-audit write and return `AUDIT_UNAVAILABLE` when it cannot be persisted.\\u003c/violation\\u003e\\n\\u003c/file\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003cfile name=\\\"hostfn/cli/src/operator.ts\\\"\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003cviolation number=\\\"1\\\" location=\\\"hostfn/cli/src/operator.ts:400\\\"\\u003e\\nP1: When an attachment lease expires while its provider call is still unwinding, another worker can reclaim the same domain ID. The stale worker’s unconditional status write can then overwrite the newer result and clear its lease, leaving provider state and admin state inconsistent. Fence both status transitions with `claimToken` using a conditional store update.\\u003c/violation\\u003e\\n\\u003c/file\\u003e\\n```\\n\\n\\u003c/details\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003csub\\u003e**Tip**: Review your code locally with the [cubic CLI](https://docs.cubic.dev/ide/cli-review?utm_source=github\\u0026utm_content=general_review_body) to iterate faster.\\u003cbr /\\u003e\\u003cbr /\\u003e[Re-trigger cubic](https://www.cubic.dev/action/re-review/pr/21nCo/super-functions/116/ai_pr_review_1787470679738_39e422e2-f209-4c8b-aa04-103de6ad35fd?returnTo=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2F21nCo%2Fsuper-functions%2Fpull%2F116)\\u003c/sub\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003c!-- cubic:review-post:ai_pr_review_1787470679738_39e422e2-f209-4c8b-aa04-103de6ad35fd:afb902dad102723f1e79c3c3cc51075aa88524dc:82794d43-c58d-4735-82d0-b67349fc5014 --\\u003e\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"afb902dad102723f1e79c3c3cc51075aa88524dc\"},\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABKiMh3g\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-08-23T07:41:30Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#pullrequestreview-5001912798\"},{\"author\":{\"login\":\"chatgpt-codex-connector\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"NONE\",\"body\":\"\\n### 💡 Codex Review\\n\\nHere are some automated review suggestions for this pull request.\\n\\n**Reviewed commit:** `afb902dad1`\\n    \\n\\n\\u003cdetails\\u003e \\u003csummary\\u003eℹ️ About Codex in GitHub\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\u003cbr/\\u003e\\n\\n[Your team has set up Codex to review pull requests in this repo](https://chatgpt.com/codex/cloud/settings/general). Reviews are triggered when you\\n- Open a pull request for review\\n- Mark a draft as ready\\n- Comment \\\"@codex review\\\".\\n\\nIf Codex has suggestions, it will comment; otherwise it will react with 👍.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nCodex can also answer questions or update the PR. Try commenting \\\"@codex address that feedback\\\".\\n            \\n\\u003c/details\\u003e\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"afb902dad102723f1e79c3c3cc51075aa88524dc\"},\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABKiM0Wg\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-08-23T07:44:37Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#pullrequestreview-5001917530\"},{\"author\":{\"login\":\"pullfrog\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"NONE\",\"body\":\"\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"afb902dad102723f1e79c3c3cc51075aa88524dc\"},\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABKiNbfQ\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-08-23T07:50:19Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#pullrequestreview-5001927549\"},{\"author\":{\"login\":\"pullfrog\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"NONE\",\"body\":\"\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"afb902dad102723f1e79c3c3cc51075aa88524dc\"},\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABKiNcng\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-08-23T07:50:22Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#pullrequestreview-5001927838\"},{\"aut