s://docs.qodo.ai/subscription-plans#linking-a-git-account)\\\\n\\\\n**Using GitHub Enterprise Server, GitLab Self-Managed, or Bitbucket Data Center?**\\\\nThese require an Enterprise plan - Contact us\\\\n[Contact us →](https://docs.qodo.ai/qodo-support#support)\\\\n\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-08-21T15:56:25Z\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"IC_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABQDVEDA\\\",\\\"includesCreatedEdit\\\":false,\\\"isMinimized\\\":false,\\\"minimizedReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"reactionGroups\\\":[],\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#issuecomment-5372199948\\\",\\\"viewerDidAuthor\\\":false},{\\\"author\\\":{\\\"login\\\":\\\"linear-code\\\"},\\\"authorAssociation\\\":\\\"CONTRIBUTOR\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\\u003c!-- linear-linkback --\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\u003cp\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\\\\"https://linear.app/21n/issue/SFNS-2\\\\\\\"\\\\u003eSFNS-2\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/p\\\\u003e\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-08-21T15:56:23Z\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"IC_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABQDVDBA\\\",\\\"includesCreatedEdit\\\":false,\\\"isMinimized\\\":false,\\\"minimizedReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"reactionGroups\\\":[],\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#issuecomment-5372199684\\\",\\\"viewerDidAuthor\\\":false}],\\\"headRefName\\\":\\\"SFNS-2\\\",\\\"headRefOid\\\":\\\"afb902dad102723f1e79c3c3cc51075aa88524dc\\\",\\\"reviews\\\":[{\\\"author\\\":{\\\"login\\\":\\\"cubic-dev-ai\\\"},\\\"authorAssociation\\\":\\\"NONE\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\\u003c!-- cubic:review-summary:start --\\\\u003e\\\\n**2 issues found across 11 files (changes from recent commits).**\\\\n\\\\u003c!-- cubic:review-summary:end --\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\n\\\\u003cdetails\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\u003csummary\\\\u003ePrompt for AI agents (unresolved issues)\\\\u003c/summary\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\n```text\\\\n\\\\nCheck if these issues are valid — if so, understand the root cause of each and fix them. If appropriate, use sub-agents to investigate and fix each issue separately.\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\u003cfile name=\\\\\\\"superconsole/src/lib/server/super-console.ts\\\\\\\"\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\n\\\\u003cviolation number=\\\\\\\"1\\\\\\\" location=\\\\\\\"superconsole/src/lib/server/super-console.ts:1089\\\\\\\"\\\\u003e\\\\nP2: When `prepareActivation` fails and the denied audit write also fails, this await escapes and the endpoint returns a generic 500 instead of the retryable 503 used for other confirmation audit failures. Wrap this denied-audit write and return `AUDIT_UNAVAILABLE` when it cannot be persisted.\\\\u003c/violation\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\u003c/file\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\n\\\\u003cfile name=\\\\\\\"hostfn/cli/src/operator.ts\\\\\\\"\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\n\\\\u003cviolation number=\\\\\\\"1\\\\\\\" location=\\\\\\\"hostfn/cli/src/operator.ts:400\\\\\\\"\\\\u003e\\\\nP1: When an attachment lease expires while its provider call is still unwinding, another worker can reclaim the same domain ID. The stale worker’s unconditional status write can then overwrite the newer result and clear its lease, leaving provider state and admin state inconsistent. Fence both status transitions with `claimToken` using a conditional store update.\\\\u003c/violation\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\u003c/file\\\\u003e\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n\\\\u003c/details\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\n\\\\u003csub\\\\u003e**Tip**: Review your code locally with the [cubic CLI](https://docs.cubic.dev/ide/cli-review?utm_source=github\\\\u0026utm_content=general_review_body) to iterate faster.\\\\u003cbr /\\\\u003e\\\\u003cbr /\\\\u003e[Re-trigger cubic](https://www.cubic.dev/action/re-review/pr/21nCo/super-functions/116/ai_pr_review_1787470679738_39e422e2-f209-4c8b-aa04-103de6ad35fd?returnTo=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2F21nCo%2Fsuper-functions%2Fpull%2F116)\\\\u003c/sub\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\n\\\\u003c!-- cubic:review-post:ai_pr_review_1787470679738_39e422e2-f209-4c8b-aa04-103de6ad35fd:afb902dad102723f1e79c3c3cc51075aa88524dc:82794d43-c58d-4735-82d0-b67349fc5014 --\\\\u003e\\\",\\\"commit\\\":{\\\"oid\\\":\\\"afb902dad102723f1e79c3c3cc51075aa88524dc\\\"},\\\"id\\\":\\\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABKiMh3g\\\",\\\"includesCreatedEdit\\\":false,\\\"reactionGroups\\\":[],\\\"state\\\":\\\"COMMENTED\\\",\\\"submittedAt\\\":\\\"2026-08-23T07:41:30Z\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#pullrequestreview-5001912798\\\"},{\\\"author\\\":{\\\"login\\\":\\\"chatgpt-codex-connector\\\"},\\\"authorAssociation\\\":\\\"NONE\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\\n### 💡 Codex Review\\\\n\\\\nHere are some automated review suggestions for this pull request.\\\\n\\\\n**Reviewed commit:** `afb902dad1`\\\\n    \\\\n\\\\n\\\\u003cdetails\\\\u003e \\\\u003csummary\\\\u003eℹ️ About Codex in GitHub\\\\u003c/summary\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\u003cbr/\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\n[Your team has set up Codex to review pull requests in this repo](https://chatgpt.com/codex/cloud/settings/general). Reviews are triggered when you\\\\n- Open a pull request for review\\\\n- Mark a draft as ready\\\\n- Comment \\\\\\\"@codex review\\\\\\\".\\\\n\\\\nIf Codex has suggestions, it will comment; otherwise it will react with 👍.\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nCodex can also answer questions or update the PR. Try commenting \\\\\\\"@codex address that feedback\\\\\\\".\\\\n            \\\\n\\\\u003c/details\\\\u003e\\\",\\\"commit\\\":{\\\"oid\\\":\\\"afb902dad102723f1e79c3c3cc51075aa88524dc\\\"},\\\"id\\\":\\\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABKiM0Wg\\\",\\\"includesCreatedEdit\\\":false,\\\"reactionGroups\\\":[],\\\"state\\\":\\\"COMMENTED\\\",\\\"submittedAt\\\":\\\"2026-08-23T07:44:37Z\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#pullrequestreview-5001917530\\\"},{\\\"author\\\":{\\\"login\\\":\\\"pullfrog\\\"},\\\"authorAssociation\\\":\\\"NONE\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"commit\\\":{\\\"oid\\\":\\\"afb902dad102723f1e79c3c3cc51075aa88524dc\\\"},\\\"id\\\":\\\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABKiNbfQ\\\",\\\"includesCreatedEdit\\\":false,\\\"reactionGroups\\\":[],\\\"state\\\":\\\"COMMENTED\\\",\\\"submittedAt\\\":\\\"2026-08-23T07:50:19Z\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#pullrequestreview-5001927549\\\"},{\\\"author\\\":{\\\"login\\\":\\\"pullfrog\\\"},\\\"authorAssociation\\\":\\\"NONE\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"commit\\\":{\\\"oid\\\":\\\"afb902dad102723f1e79c3c3cc51075aa88524dc\\\"},\\\"id\\\":\\\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABKiNcng\\\",\\\"includesCreatedEdit\\\":false,\\\"reactionGroups\\\":[],\\\"state\\\":\\\"COMMENTED\\\",\\\"submittedAt\\\":\\\"2026-08-23T07:50:22Z\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#pullrequestreview-5001927838\\\"},{\\\"author\\\":{\\\"login\\\":\\\"pullfrog\\\"},\\\"authorAssociation\\\":\\\"NONE\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"commit\\\":{\\\"oid\\\":\\\"afb902dad102723f1e79c3c3cc51075aa88524dc\\\"},\\\"id\\\":\\\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABKiNdIw\\\",\\\"includesCreatedEdit\\\":false,\\\"reactionGroups\\\":[],\\\"state\\\":\\\"COMMENTED\\\",\\\"submittedAt\\\":\\\"2026-08-23T07:50:25Z\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#pullrequestreview-5001927971\\\"},{\\\"author\\\":{\\\"login\\\":\\\"pullfrog\\\"},\\\"authorAssociation\\\":\\\"NONE\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"commit\\\":{\\\"oid\\\":\\\"afb902dad102723f1e79c3c3cc51075aa88524dc\\\"},\\\"id\\\":\\\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABKiNeDQ\\\",\\\"includesCreatedEdit\\\":false,\\\"reactionGroups\\\":[],\\\"state\\\":\\\"COMMENTED\\\",\\\"submittedAt\\\":\\\"2026-08-23T07:50:28Z\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#pullrequestreview-5001928205\\\"},{\\\"author\\\":{\\\"login\\\":\\\"pullfrog\\\"},\\\"authorAssociation\\\":\\\"NONE\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\\u003e [!IMPORTANT]\\\\n\\\\u003e The latest fixes close the four prior Pullfrog threads, but the new durable recovery contracts still permit stale or denied work to become authoritative.\\\\n\\\\n**Reviewed changes** since the prior Pullfrog review at `16a31f1`:\\\\n\\\\n- **Reserved HostFn attachment identities** — added atomic cross-instance domain claims, retry convergence, and provider-not-found variable deletion reconciliation.\\\\n- **Hardened JSON validation** — switched structural object ordering to code-unit comparison and rejected unsupported values during `uniqueItems` validation.\\\\n- **Preserved action-form intersections** — retained repeated property constraints from every `allOf` branch and applied nested validation to primitive fields.\\\\n- **Prepared confirmation activation** — durably bound staged tokens to their future success-audit IDs and documented post-interruption reconciliation.\\\\n\\\\n\\\\u003c!--\\\\nPullfrog review metadata. These findings were written against afb902d;\\\\nif commits have landed on SFNS-2 since, treat every specific bug, file, or\\\\nline callout as POTENTIALLY STALE and re-diff before acting on it.\\\\n\\\\n- Mode: IncrementalReview (delta against prior pullfrog review)\\\\n- Files reviewed: 1801\\\\n- Commits reviewed: 30\\\\n- Base: dev (72aabce)\\\\n- Head: SFNS-2 (afb902d)\\\\n- Reviewed commits:\\\\n  - afb902d — fix: close current PR review gaps\\\\n  - 16a31f1 — fix: address latest PR review findings\\\\n  - db08968 — fix: close reconciliation review gaps\\\\n  - 73485e8 — fix: reconcile pending admin side effects\\\\n  - fbb3868 — fix: resolve single-pass PR review findings\\\\n  - 9cf9e61 — fix: close single-pass review findings\\\\n  - 966f314 — fix: resolve final admin review round\\\\n  - b1157c7 — fix: resolve latest admin review findings\\\\n  - 09ff931 — fix: close post-push admin review gaps\\\\n  - e3e7054 — fix: harden final admin review edges\\\\n  - a3a6f63 — fix: resolve final console review findings\\\\n  - 9bd82d2 — fix: canonicalize MCP cursor identity\\\\n  - 358c4d2 — fix: close final PR review gaps\\\\n  - c6aea5c — fix: preserve Svelte controller prop routing\\\\n  - b2718e4 — fix: address final refetched review findings\\\\n  - 5e968d7 — refactor: keep cursor identity package-local\\\\n  - 593b81f — fix: close post-refetch review issues\\\\n  - a422e0f — fix: address final PR review wave\\\\n  - 239ba00 — fix: close remaining review edge cases\\\\n  - 0daaba2 — fix: address post-push review feedback\\\\n  - 616f549 — fix: resolve refreshed PR review findings\\\\n  - 94c8cc3 — fix: keep webhook metadata lint-clean\\\\n  - e1062e1 — test: allow Svelte catalog render in CI\\\\n  - 21fbc39 — fix: address latest PR review findings\\\\n  - e3800be — fix: track SuperConsole app error types\\\\n  - 9307965 — fix: address post-push review feedback\\\\n  - e1f368a — fix: address refreshed admin review findings\\\\n  - 8ad9b66 — fix: address latest PR review feedback\\\\n  - 8d16f12 — fix: address PR review feedback\\\\n  - d27cceb — SFNS-2 port Super Console admin surfaces to dev\\\\n- Prior pullfrog review: 16a31f1 (https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#pullrequestreview-5001826361)\\\\n--\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\n\\\\u003c!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ --\\\\u003e\\\\n\\\\u003csup\\\\u003e\\\\u003ca href=\\\\\\\"https://pullfrog.com\\\\\\\"\\\\u003e\\\\u003cpicture\\\\u003e\\\\u003csource media=\\\\\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\\\\\" srcset=\\\\\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\\\\\\\"\\\\u003e\\\\u003cimg src=\\\\\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-green-full-18px.png\\\\\\\" width=\\\\\\\"9px\\\\\\\" height=\\\\\\\"9px\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"vertical-align: middle; \\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\"Pullfrog\\\\\\\"\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/picture\\\\u003e\\\\u003c/a\\\\u003e\\\\u0026nbsp;\\\\u0026nbsp;｜ [Fix all ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/116?action=fix\\\\u0026review_id=5001934873) ｜ [Fix 👍s ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/116?action=fix-approved\\\\u0026review_id=5001934873) ｜ [View workflow run](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/actions/runs/32626073314/job/97161527435) ｜ Using `GPT Sol` ｜ [𝕏](https://x.com/pullfrogai)\\\\u003c/sup\\\\u003e\\\",\\\"commit\\\":{\\\"oid\\\":\\\"afb902dad102723f1e79c3c3cc51075aa88524dc\\\"},\\\"id\\\":\\\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAA