{"timestamp":"2026-08-23T10:43:24.752Z","ordinal":12915,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a024c5-b91b-72b3-ad56-490032d022a1","turn_id":"01a02e2d-cfe6-7e21-8f45-566081da5b6e","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0d3207775ece027d016a8acec520b487d09d9d70be36fee1b7","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"One bounded review round is complete.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- HostFn in-flight attachment/deletion race, including provider compensation.\n- Exact cancellation-to-denial audit ID linkage.\n- Ambiguous confirmation activation no longer returns a misleading 503 with an unreturned token.\n- Create/upsert-style ID-targeted writes are exposed before records exist.\n- Open schemas reject `bigint`, `symbol`, functions, and `undefined`.\n- BotFn cursors are bound to scope, collection, and channel filter.\n- ApiFn cursors are bound to scope and resource.\n\n### Skipped (Already Fixed / Stale)\n\nOlder unresolved/outdated findings already addressed by the current implementation.\n\n### Not Attempted\n\n- Sonar aggregate quality-gate bookkeeping.\n- Unrelated default-branch dependency advisories.\n- External CI and reviewer processing.\n\n### Verification\n\n- 302 tests passed.\n- Relevant TypeScript, Svelte, function-agnostic, and server-build checks passed.\n- Pushed commit `d9b60c51a3517f5b7635b4a8d224ae62a9f914e1` to [PR #116](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116).\n- Local and remote branch heads match.\n- The single immediate PR metadata check still returned the previous head, likely propagation delay; per the skill boundary, I did not poll.\n- Existing untracked `.conduct` artifacts were excluded.\n\nOne review round is complete. No post-push feedback refetch, CI wait, or additional review loop was performed.\n\n"}],"phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":{"entries":[{"path":"MEMORY.md","lineStart":1254,"lineEnd":1254,"note":"unresolved thread first review workflow"}],"rolloutIds":["019fecb5-747a-7c62-81eb-5e89c9d57515","019ff8ab-73