{"timestamp":"2026-08-23T11:46:46.212Z","ordinal":13004,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a024c5-b91b-72b3-ad56-490032d022a1","turn_id":"01a02e6e-3560-7e22-a95e-b95a3d227c08","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0d3207775ece027d016a8adda3ec2c87d0a6aa0fac3fb5e6c2","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Five deduplicated root causes are current and valid: metadata cursor identity, malformed cursor envelopes in ApiFn/BotFn, unresolved theme-token references, non-durable HostFn compensation failure, and confirmation success semantics after rejected activation. Older threads remain stale; Sonar’s aggregate gate is bookkeeping rather than a concrete scoped finding. I’m applying these five fixes with regression coverage."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1787485604013,"completed_at_ms":1787485606212}}
