{"timestamp":"2026-08-23T12:55:23.140Z","ordinal":13164,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a02eb0-a304-7572-b3c0-eb6cd70e913e","call_id":"call_7RwqYCCM4AueeGeTGghoAzLQ","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 11850)\nTotal output lines: 1\n\n[{\"name\":\"mcp__codex_apps__plugin_management_get_plugin_dependencies\",\"description\":\"Manage plugins, settings, permissions, and connections. Prefer available built-in tools or connected plugins when they fit the task. Proactively search for plugins when an external app, account, or service would materially help, even if the user did not request a plugin. Search before claiming a service is unavailable or suggesting manual workarounds. Do not suggest plugins for native web search, image generation, memory, or sites unless a specific external provider or missing capability is needed.\\n\\nResolve the canonical public plugins declared by one plugin's app manifest. Use only when a skill or user explicitly asks for dependency metadata. Pass a plugin ID or name@marketplace reference unchanged. Named references resolve by globally listed plugin name. This reports metadata plus current user-aware plugin status, installation policy, and installed state; it does not install or connect anything. The result separates visible canonical plugins from app entries that lack a unique canonical plugin or whose canonical plugin is unavailable to the current user. This tool is part of plugin `Plugin Management`.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__codex_apps__plugin_management_get_plugin_dependencies(args: {\\n  // Plugin ID or name@marketplace reference whose manifest dependencies should be resolved. Pass it unchanged.\\n  plugin_reference: string;\\n}): Promise<CallToolResult<{\\n  // The server's response to a tool call.\\n  result: { _meta?: { [key: string]: unknown; } | null; content: Array<{ _meta?: { [key: string]: unknown; } | null; annotations?: { audience?: Array<\\\"user\\\" | \\\"assistant\\\"> | null; priority?: number | null; } | null; text: string; type: \\\"text\\\"; } | { _meta?: { [key: string]: unknown; } | null; annotations?: { audience?: Array<\\\"user\\\" | \\\"assistant\\\"> | null; priority?: number | null; } | null; data: string; mimeType: string; type: \\\"image\\\"; } | { _meta?: { [key: string]: unknown; } | null; annotations?: { audience?: Array<\\\"user\\\" | \\\"assistant\\\"> | null; priority?: number | null; } | null; data: string; mimeType: string; type: \\\"audio\\\"; } | { _meta?: { [key: string]: unknown; } | null; annotations?: { audience?: Array<\\\"user\\\" | \\\"assistant\\\"> | null; priority?: number | null; } | null; description?: string | null; icons?: Array<{ mimeType?: string | null; sizes?: Array<string> | null; src: string; }> | null; mimeType?: string | null; name: string; size?: number | null; title?: string | null; type: \\\"resource_link\\\"; uri: string; } | { _meta?: { [key: string]: unknown; } | null; annotations?: { audience?: Array<\\\"user\\\" | \\\"assistant\\\"> | null; priority?: number | null; } | null; resource: { _meta?: { [key: string]: unknown; } | null; mimeType?: string | null; text: string; uri: string; } | { _meta?: { [key: string]: unknown; } | null; blob: string; mimeType?: string | null; uri: string; }; type: \\\"resource\\\"; }>; isError?: boolean; structuredContent?: { [key: string]: unknown; } | null; };\\n}>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__skillplane__context_archive\",\"description\":\"Discover, retrieve, and manage versioned Skillplane skills and their authorized context knowledge. Start with workspaces_list, skills_list, and contexts_list when identifiers are unknown. All caller identity fields are declared metadata; authentication remains server-derived.\\n\\nArchive one authorized context using the exact previously observed updatedAt value, durable transactional audit, and replay-safe idempotency.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__skillplane__context_archive(args: { caller: { agentId: string; agentName: string; clientName: string; clientVersion: string; conversationId: string; modelName: string; modelProvider: string; modelVersion: string; runId: string; sessionId: string; }; context: { id: string; } | { slug: string; }; expectedUpdatedAt: string; idempotencyKey: string; skill: { id: string; } | { skillSlug: string; workspaceSlug: string; }; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ context: { archivedAt: string | null; createdAt: string; currentKnowledge: { id: string; revision: number; } | null; description: string; externalReference: string | null; id: string; metadata: { [key: string]: unknown; }; name: string; skillId: string; slug: string; type: \\\"repository\\\" | \\\"project\\\" | \\\"customer\\\" | \\\"environment\\\" | \\\"custom\\\"; updatedAt: string; }; requestId: string; skillId: string; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__skillplane__context_create\",\"description\":\"Discover, retrieve, and manage versioned Skillplane skills and their authorized context knowledge. Start with workspaces_list, skills_list, and contexts_list when identifiers are unknown. All caller identity fields are declared metadata; authentication remains server-derived.\\n\\nAtomically create one authorized skill context and its first immutable knowledge revision with bounded metadata, caller attribution, durable audit, and replay-safe idempotency.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__skillplane__context_create(args: { caller: { agentId: string; agentName: string; clientName: string; clientVersion: string; conversationId: string; modelName: string; modelProvider: string; modelVersion: string; runId: string; sessionId: string; }; description?: string; externalReference?: string | null; idempotencyKey: string; initialKnowledge: string; learningMetadata?: { [key: string]: unknown; }; metadata?: { [key: string]: unknown; }; name: string; skill: { id: string; } | { skillSlug: string; workspaceSlug: string; }; slug: string; type: \\\"repository\\\" | \\\"project\\\" | \\\"customer\\\" | \\\"environment\\\" | \\\"custom\\\"; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ context: { archivedAt: string | null; createdAt: string; currentKnowledge: { id: string; revision: number; } | null; description: string; externalReference: string | null; id: string; metadata: { [key: string]: unknown; }; name: string; skillId: string; slug: string; type: \\\"repository\\\" | \\\"project\\\" | \\\"customer\\\" | \\\"environment\\\" | \\\"custom\\\"; updatedAt: string; }; knowledge: { baseRevisionId: string | null; createdAt: string; createdBy: { actorType: \\\"user\\\" | \\\"service_principal\\\"; agent: string | null; model: string | null; }; digest: string; id: string; learningMetadata: { [key: string]: unknown; }; markdown: string; revision: number; }; requestId: string; skillId: string; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__skillplane__context_get\",\"description\":\"Discover, retrieve, and manage versioned Skillplane skills and their authorized context knowledge. Start with workspaces_list, skills_list, and contexts_list when identifiers are unknown. All caller identity fields are declared metadata; authentication remains server-derived.\\n\\nRead one authorized skill context with an exact current or selected immutable knowledge revision and, when requested, active shared notes.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__skillplane__context_get(args: { caller: { agentId: string; agentName: string; clientName: string; clientVersion: string; conversationId: string; modelName: string; modelProvider: string; modelVersion: string; runId: string; sessionId: string; }; context: { id: string; } | { slug: string; }; includeNotes?: boolean; knowledge?: { selector: \\\"current\\\"; } | { revisionId: string; selector: \\\"revisionId\\\"; } | { revision: number; selector: \\\"revision\\\"; }; skill: { id: string; } | { skillSlug: string; workspaceSlug: string; }; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ context: { description: string; externalReference: string | null; id: string; knowledge: { createdAt: string; digest: string; id: string; markdown: string; revision: number; } | null; metadata: { [key: string]: unknown; }; name: string; notes: Array<{ archivedAt: string | null; currentRevision: { createdAt: string; digest: string; id: string; markdown: string; revision: number; }; id: string; slug: string; title: string; updatedAt: string; }>; slug: string; type: \\\"repository\\\" | \\\"customer\\\" | \\\"environment\\\" | \\\"project\\\" | \\\"custom\\\"; }; requestId: string; skillId: string; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__skillplane__context_knowledge_history\",\"description\":\"Discover, retrieve, and manage versioned Skillplane skills and their authorized context knowledge. Start with workspaces_list, skills_list, and contexts_list when identifiers are unknown. All caller identity fields are declared metadata; authentication remains server-derived.\\n\\nList immutable knowledge revisions for one authorized context with Markdown, digests, learning metadata, safe agent/model provenance, and an opaque filter-bound cursor.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__skillplane__context_knowledge_history(args: { caller: { agentId: string; agentName: string; clientName: string; clientVersion: string; conversationId: string; modelName: string; modelProvider: string; modelVersion: string; runId: string; sessionId: string; }; context: { id: string; } | { slug: string; }; cursor?: string | null; limit?: number; skill: { id: string; } | { skillSlug: string; workspaceSlug: string; }; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ contextId: string; nextCursor: string | null; requestId: string; revisions: Array<{ baseRevisionId: string | null; createdAt: string; createdBy: { actorType: \\\"user\\\" | \\\"service_pri