space without a search query. Includes active unpublished skill records, supports visibility and archive filters, and returns an opaque cursor until every matching skill has been listed.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__skillplane__skills_list(args: { caller: { agentId: string; agentName: string; clientName: string; clientVersion: string; conversationId: string; modelName: string; modelProvider: string; modelVersion: string; runId: string; sessionId: string; }; cursor?: string | null; limit?: number; state?: \\\"active\\\" | \\\"archived\\\" | \\\"all\\\"; visibility?: Array<\\\"private\\\" | \\\"workspace\\\" | \\\"public\\\">; workspace: { id: string; } | { slug: string; }; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ nextCursor: string | null; requestId: string; skills: Array<{ archivedAt: string | null; currentVersion: { id: string; semanticVersion: string; } | null; id: string; name: string; slug: string; summary: string; tags: Array<string>; updatedAt: string; visibility: \\\"private\\\" | \\\"workspace\\\" | \\\"public\\\"; workspaceId: string; workspaceSlug: string; }>; workspace: { id: string; kind: \\\"personal\\\" | \\\"organization\\\"; name: string; slug: string; }; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__skillplane__skills_search\",\"description\":\"Discover, retrieve, and manage versioned Skillplane skills and their authorized context knowledge. Start with workspaces_list, skills_list, and contexts_list when identifiers are unknown. All caller identity fields are declared metadata; authentication remains server-derived.\\n\\nSearch one workspace using authorization-filtered Postgres full-text ranking. Returns only stable skill metadata, current published version IDs, semantic versions, digests, and an opaque cursor.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__skillplane__skills_search(args: { caller: { agentId: string; agentName: string; clientName: string; clientVersion: string; conversationId: string; modelName: string; modelProvider: string; modelVersion: string; runId: string; sessionId: string; }; cursor?: string | null; limit?: number; query: string; tags?: Array<string>; visibility?: Array<\\\"private\\\" | \\\"workspace\\\" | \\\"public\\\">; workspaceId: string; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ nextCursor: string | null; requestId: string; skills: Array<{ currentVersion: { digest: string; id: string; semanticVersion: string; }; id: string; name: string; slug: string; summary: string; tags: Array<string>; visibility: \\\"private\\\" | \\\"workspace\\\" | \\\"public\\\"; workspaceId: string; workspaceSlug: string; }>; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__skillplane__workspaces_list\",\"description\":\"Discover, retrieve, and manage versioned Skillplane skills and their authorized context knowledge. Start with workspaces_list, skills_list, and contexts_list when identifiers are unknown. All caller identity fields are declared metadata; authentication remains server-derived.\\n\\nDiscover every workspace available to the authenticated OAuth user, or the single workspace bound to an agent credential, using an opaque cursor. No workspace identifier is required.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__skillplane__workspaces_list(args: { caller: { agentId: string; agentName: string; clientName: string; clientVersion: string; conversationId: string; modelName: string; modelProvider: string; modelVersion: string; runId: string; sessionId: string; }; cursor?: string | null; limit?: number; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ nextCursor: string | null; requestId: string; workspaces: Array<{ id: string; kind: \\\"personal\\\" | \\\"organization\\\"; name: string; role: \\\"viewer\\\" | \\\"editor\\\" | \\\"admin\\\" | \\\"owner\\\"; slug: string; updatedAt: string; }>; }>>; };\\n```\"}]"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a02eb0-78a7-7a20-b243-beaa58cdcdc6","create_time":1787489723.140247}}}
