{"timestamp":"2026-08-23T17:32:50.106Z","ordinal":13948,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a02fae-a638-7550-894d-b656e80386c4","call_id":"call_yOgLhCqKqSHhSjC81kFwHf9O","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.8 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"144:- For a live PR fix pass, refetch paginated GraphQL review threads plus reviews, issue comments, and inline comments; validate against the exact head, then merge with an exact-head guard. PR #48 merged to `next` at `523c66ae8cf981ff8331d56386cec1f81c704182`. [Task 1]\n642:- Do not create the preservation worktree from remote `sf-next/next`; anchor it at the pre-sync local commit. Do not use broad `git add` in a mixed worktree: stage an explicit path allowlist, refetch current review threads, and use `gh pr merge --match-head-commit` after the broad gate passes. [Task 1]\n880:- Skillplane, PostHog wizard, PR #4, codex/posthog-mcp-analytics, analytics.ts, flush, product analytics, review threads\n888:- Use the dedicated clean PR worktree at exact head; refetch unresolved GraphQL review threads, validate only live findings, rerun local gates, push, wait for checks, refetch again, then merge with `--match-head-commit`. The official PostHog wizard required Node `>=22.22.0`; launch was verified but browser OAuth/project selection was not. [Task 1]\n1228:- PR #103, 21n/report-and-fix-pr@1.0.0, SF-8-ci-fixes, reviewThreads, 46 unique findings, Ruff, mypy, PlugFn, 236 review threads, delivery claim token\n1254:- when the user invokes `pr-refetch-fix`, check unresolved GraphQL review threads first, then review bodies, issue comments, and inline comments; do not filter by timestamps only. [Task 3]\n1272:- Symptom: review fixes are based on stale or incomplete feedback. Cause: only one review surface or an old local checkout was inspected. Fix: query current review threads and source at exact head, then use a clean dedicated worktree for confirmed edits. [Task 1][Task 3][Task 6]\nworktree /Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/superfunctions\nHEAD 523c66ae8cf981ff8331d56386cec1f81c704182\nbranch refs/heads/next\n\nworktree /Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/superfunctions-dev\nHEAD 60d32b4058286bff8cfc8b48a347a4e0bff22230\nbranch refs/heads/SFNS-2\n\nworktree /Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/worktrees/superfunctions/DEV-1\nHEAD 523c66ae8cf981ff8331d56386cec1f81c704182\ndetached\n\nworktree /Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/worktrees/superfunctions/DEV-1-origin-dev\nHEAD a6f14b40d0be1f1d3aeb47c3267204e3f24c72c0\nbranch refs/heads/DEV-1\n\nSFNS-2\n?? .conduct/pr-reports/21nco-super-functions-pr-116-20260821-223157.md\n?? .conduct/pr-reports/21nco-super-functions-pr-116-comments.json\n?? superconsole/.conduct/\norigin\thttps://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.git (fetch)\norigin\thttps://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.git (push)\nsf-next\thttps://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next.git (fetch)\nsf-next\thttps://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next.git (push)\n{\"baseRefName\":\"dev\",\"headRefName\":\"SFNS-2\",\"headRefOid\":\"60d32b4058286bff8cfc8b48a347a4e0bff22230\",\"number\":116,\"url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116\"}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a02fae-186f-7650-a011-b5cdec75b51c","create_time":1787506370.104399}}}
