ctions.onOutsideInteraction()` still closes the open Dialog.\thttps://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#discussion_r3839032558\nPRRT_kwDOP-e7KM6bgpD5\tuifn/dom/browser/overlay-harness.ts\t206\tfalse\t2026-08-23T16:41:28Z\tpullfrog\t`Dialog` has `policy.position: 'none'`, so this binding never creates a positioner and `dataset.side` remains unset. This makes the Playwright overlay matrix fail without covering live placement reconciliation; exercise placement on a positioned primitive while retaining the Dialog modal assertions.\thttps://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#discussion_r3839032562\nPRRT_kwDOP-e7KM6bgpD6\tuifn/dom/src/presence.ts\t58\tfalse\t2026-08-23T16:41:28Z\tpullfrog\tCSS uses `transition-property` and `animation-name` as the master lists, so duration and delay list lengths can exceed the number of events the browser emits. After the real motion ends, Presence can therefore remain `entering` or `exiting` until the fallback timer fires.\thttps://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#discussion_r3839032565\n5002858363\tcubic-dev-ai[bot]\tCOMMENTED\t2026-08-23T16:36:46Z\t<!-- cubic:review-summary:start -->\thttps://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#pullrequestreview-5002858363\n5002858898\tchatgpt-codex-connector[bot]\tCOMMENTED\t2026-08-23T16:37:04Z\t\thttps://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#pullrequestreview-5002858898\n5002863341\tpullfrog[bot]\tCOMMENTED\t2026-08-23T16:39:32Z\t\thttps://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#pullrequestreview-5002863341\n5002866857\tpullfrog[bot]\tCOMMENTED\t2026-08-23T16:41:29Z\t> [!IMPORTANT]\thttps://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#pullrequestreview-5002866857\n5387085180\tsonarqubecloud[bot]\t2026-08-23T16:33:36Z\t## [![Quality Gate Failed](https://sonarsource.github.io/sonarcloud-github-static-resources/v2/checks/QualityGateBadge/qg-failed-20px.png 'Quality Gate Failed')](https://sonarcloud.io/dashboard?id=21nCo_super-functions&pullRequest=116) **Quality Gate fa