vers when their elements change.\n- **Separated focus suspension state** — distinguished explicit pauses from stack-derived suspension and added three-level enable, disable, and destroy regressions.\n- **Hardened controller and date updates** — made invalid AlertDialog updates transactional and replaced overflow-prone month-length calculation at JavaScript's upper date boundary.\n- **Reworked motion and cleanup tracking** — counted declared presence motions and removed released DOM resources from the scope's retained cleanup collection.\n\n<!--\nPullfrog review metadata. These findings were written against 60d32b4;\nif commits have landed on SFNS-2 since, treat every specific bug, file, or\nline callout as POTENTIALLY STALE and re-diff before acting on it.\n\n- Mode: IncrementalReview (delta against prior pullfrog review)\n- Files reviewed: 15\n- Commits reviewed: 1\n- Base: dev (72aabce)\n- Head: SFNS-2 (60d32b4)\n- Reviewed commits:\n  - 60d32b4 — fix(uifn): address latest overlay review findings\n- Prior pullfrog review: 66ccad4 (https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#pullrequestreview-5002768476)\n-->\n\n<!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ -->\n<sup><a href=\"https://pullfrog.com\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\"><img src=\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-green-full-18px.png\" width=\"9px\" height=\"9px\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; \" alt=\"Pullfrog\"></picture></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;｜ [Fix all ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/116?action=fix&review_id=5002866857) ｜ [Fix 👍s ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/116?action=fix-approved&review_id=5002866857) ｜ [View workflow run](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/actions/runs/32651884840/job/97224673820) ｜ Using `GPT Sol` ｜ [𝕏](https://x.com/pullfrogai)</sup>\n\n"},"started_at_ms":1787506946943,"completed_at_ms":1787506946943}}
