{"timestamp":"2026-08-23T17:52:12.470Z","ordinal":14303,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a024c5-b91b-72b3-ad56-490032d022a1","turn_id":"01a02fbf-93d2-7042-8dc6-d04fcf6e99cc","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0d3207775ece027d016a8b334a53b887d08f2a7db1d171e048","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Because the initial PR commit (`d27cceb2`) mistakenly copied the local dependency graph from `next`:\n\n- `packages/admin` depends on `@mcpfn/core`.\n- `superconsole` depends on the `@uifn/*` packages.\n\nSo the commit explicitly added 19 `mcpfn` files and 1,581 `uifn` files; they were not inherited from `dev`. This exceeded the intended scope. The later review-fix rounds then modified those files instead of recognizing they should not be in the PR."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1787507530402,"completed_at_ms":1787507532470}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-23T17:52:12.478Z","ordinal":14304,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0d3207775ece027d016a8b334a53b887d08f2a7db1d171e048","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Because the initial PR commit (`d27cceb2`) mistakenly copied the local dependency graph from `next`:\n\n- `packages/admin` depends on `@mcpfn/core`.\n- `superconsole` depends on the `@uifn/*` packages.\n\nSo the commit explicitly added 19 `mcpfn` files and 1,581 `uifn` files; they were not inherited from `dev`. This exceeded the intended scope. The later review-fix rounds then modified those files instead of recognizing they should not be in the PR."}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a02fbf-93d2-7042-8dc6-d04fcf6e99cc"}}}
