ile>\\n\\n<file name=\\\"uifn/core/scripts/build.mjs\\\">\\n\\n<violation number=\\\"1\\\" location=\\\"uifn/core/scripts/build.mjs:24\\\">\\nP1: When the build reaches `accordion`, it asks tsup to bundle nonexistent `createAccordionController`, so the build fails before producing any public primitive entrypoints. Add the missing controller exports or map catalog entries to verified source exports before bundling.</violation>\\n</file>\\n```\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<sub>**Note:** This PR contains a large number of files. cubic selects up to 200 of the highest-priority eligible files for this review, so some files may not have been reviewed.<br /><br />[Re-trigger cubic](https://www.cubic.dev/action/re-review/pr/21nCo/super-functions/116/ai_pr_review_1787327791163_a1a350bd-38ed-428d-ad31-51af760b767a?returnTo=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2F21nCo%2Fsuper-functions%2Fpull%2F116)</sub>\\n\\n<!-- cubic:review-post:ai_pr_review_1787327791163_a1a350bd-38ed-428d-ad31-51af760b767a:d27cceb2b786bcb08c2be5445ece12146c1123c4:7bb8304f-392d-4952-ab05-eaf35f279889 -->\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"chatgpt-codex-connector\",\n      \"state\": \"COMMENTED\",\n      \"submittedAt\": \"2026-08-22T02:55:54Z\",\n      \"body\": \"\\n### 💡 Codex Review\\n\\nHere are some automated review suggestions for this pull request.\\n\\n**Reviewed commit:** `8d16f12d9a`\\n    \\n\\n<details> <summary>ℹ️ About Codex in GitHub</summary>\\n<br/>\\n\\n[Your team has set up Codex to review pull requests in this repo](https://chatgpt.com/codex/cloud/settings/general). Reviews are triggered when you\\n- Open a pull request for review\\n- Mark a draft as ready\\n- Comment \\\"@codex review\\\".\\n\\nIf Codex has suggestions, it will comment; otherwise it will react with 👍.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nCodex can also answer questions or update the PR. Try commenting \\\"@codex address that feedback\\\".\\n            \\n</details>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"pullfrog\",\n      \"state\": \"COMMENTED\",\n      \