t\": \"2026-08-22T08:53:04Z\",\n      \"body\": \"> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> The refreshed fixes leave one new CSRF contract regression that should be addressed before merge.\\n\\n**Reviewed changes** since the prior reviewed head at `94c8cc3`:\\n\\n- **Expanded generic resource presentation** — added DataFn's required resource filter and parent-bound FileFn child collections for the function-agnostic console.\\n\\n- **Corrected FileFn operation contracts** — preserved signed download descriptors, retained implicit credential redaction and audit, and targeted share revocation at its parent file.\\n\\n- **Hardened shared runtime contracts** — moved HostFn cursors to the Unicode-safe shared codec, rejected duplicate MCP resource-template URIs, and projected CSRF metadata for POST reads.\\n\\n- **Added first-class PlugFn workflow tenancy** — introduced schema version 7, switched administration to `Workflow.tenantId`, and documented schema/backfill sequencing.\\n\\n- **Tightened UIFn edge handling** — rejected partial grapheme matches without `Intl.Segmenter` and added deterministic scheduler flushing plus stronger Phase 14 action heuristics.\\n\\n<!--\\nPullfrog review metadata. These findings were written against 616f549;\\nif commits have landed on SFNS-2 since, treat every specific bug, file, or\\nline callout as POTENTIALLY STALE and re-diff before acting on it.\\n\\n- Mode: IncrementalReview (delta against prior pullfrog review)\\n- Files reviewed: 19\\n- Commits reviewed: 1\\n- Base: dev (72aabce)\\n- Head: SFNS-2 (616f549)\\n- Reviewed commits:\\n  - 616f549 — fix: resolve refreshed PR review findings\\n- Prior pullfrog review: 21fbc39 (https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#pullrequestreview-4999515753)\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ -->\\n<sup><a href=\\\"https://pullfrog.com\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\\\"><img src=\\\"https://pullfrog.com