{\n      \"id\": \"PRRT_kwDOP-e7KM6bODkV\",\n      \"path\": \"superconsole/src/lib/server/transport.ts\",\n      \"line\": 25,\n      \"latest\": {\n        \"id\": \"PRRC_kwDOP-e7KM7kZbRE\",\n        \"author\": \"cubic-dev-ai\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-21T16:19:46Z\",\n        \"outdated\": false,\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#discussion_r3831870532\",\n        \"body\": \"<!-- cubic:v=05cd7d52-7765-4642-984e-06e0eeb18aec -->\\n<!-- cubic:review-run=7bb8304f-392d-4952-ab05-eaf35f279889 -->\\n<!-- metadata:{\\\"confidence\\\":9} -->\\nP2: When an installation sets `apiBasePath` to anything other than `/api/admin/v1`, the mounted transport cannot serve it: custom-path requests do not match these routes, while requests at the fixed path are rejected as outside the configured API. Constrain this option for the SvelteKit transport or mount/delegate routes using the configured base path.\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>Prompt for AI agents</summary>\\n\\n```text\\nCheck if this issue is valid — if so, understand the root cause and fix it. At superconsole/src/lib/server/transport.ts, line 25:\\n\\n<comment>When an installation sets `apiBasePath` to anything other than `/api/admin/v1`, the mounted transport cannot serve it: custom-path requests do not match these routes, while requests at the fixed path are rejected as outside the configured API. Constrain this option for the SvelteKit transport or mount/delegate routes using the configured base path.</comment>\\n\\n<file context>\\n@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@\\n+      headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json; charset=utf-8', 'cache-control': 'no-store' },\\n+    });\\n+  }\\n+  return console.handle(request);\\n+}\\n</file context>\\n```\\n\\n</details>\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"PRRT_kwDOP-e7KM6bODlX\",\n      \"path\": \"filefn/server/src/files/service.ts\",\n      \"line\": 855,\n      \"latest\": {\n        \"id\": \"PRRC_kwDOP-e7KM7kZbSd\",\n        \"author\": \