 React with 👍 / 👎.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"staleCount\": 128\n}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":5,"nanos":288349958},"formatted_output":"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 14587)\nTotal output lines: 591\n\n{\n  \"count\": 173,\n  \"current\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"PRRT_kwDOP-e7KM6bODiv\",\n      \"path\": \"superconsole/examples/dev-installation.ts\",\n      \"line\": 72,\n      \"latest\": {\n        \"id\": \"PRRC_kwDOP-e7KM7kZbOp\",\n        \"author\": \"cubic-dev-ai\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-21T16:19:45Z\",\n        \"outdated\": false,\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/116#discussion_r3831870377\",\n        \"body\": \"<!-- cubic:v=792cf675-1d9e-4123-acee-f8303925c123 -->\\n<!-- cubic:review-run=7bb8304f-392d-4952-ab05-eaf35f279889 -->\\n<!-- metadata:{\\\"confidence\\\":8} -->\\nP1: When this module is loaded directly via `SUPERCONSOLE_INSTALLATION`, the installation loader invokes its similarly named factory without arguments, so startup throws before creating the console. Export a no-argument deployment wrapper, or rename this options-taking helper so it cannot be selected as the loader entry point.\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>Prompt for AI agents</summary>\\n\\n```text\\nCheck if this issue is valid — if so, understand the root cause and fix it. At superconsole/examples/dev-installation.ts, line 72:\\n\\n<comment>When this module is loaded directly via `SUPERCONSOLE_INSTALLATION`, the installation loader invokes its similarly named factory without arguments, so startup throws before creating the console. Export a no-argument deployment wrapper, or rename this options-taking helper so it cannot be selected as the loader entry point.</comment>\\n\\n<file context>\\n@@ -0,0 +1,78 @@\\n+};\\n+\\n+/** Compose this from real function-owned adapters and deployment-owned infrastructure. */\\n+export function createDevSuperConsoleInstallation(options: DevSuperConsoleOptions): SuperConsole {\\n+  c