{"timestamp":"2026-08-26T12:06:53.741Z","ordinal":14794,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a024c5-b91b-72b3-ad56-490032d022a1","turn_id":"01a03df6-e6e1-7a72-a0b5-21d4875eed74","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-cb9920a8-b059-4395-97ca-023c19db3a62","process_id":"98040","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","git fetch origin SFNS-2 && git branch --show-current && git status --short --branch && git remote -v && git rev-parse HEAD origin/SFNS-2 && git show -s --format='%H%n%cI' HEAD && GH_CONFIG_DIR=/Users/serro/.config/gh-other gh pr view 116 --repo 21nCo/super-functions --json number,url,state,headRefName,headRefOid,baseRefName,mergeable,mergeStateStatus"],"cwd":"file:///Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/superfunctions-dev","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git fetch origin SFNS-2 && git branch --show-current && git status --short --branch && git remote -v && git rev-parse HEAD origin/SFNS-2 && git show -s --format='%H%n%cI' HEAD && GH_CONFIG_DIR=/Users/serro/.config/gh-other gh pr view 116 --repo 21nCo/super-functions --json number,url,state,headRefName,headRefOid,baseRefName,mergeable,mergeStateStatus"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"From https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions\n * branch              SFNS-2     -> FETCH_HEAD\nSFNS-2\n## SFNS-2...origin/SFNS-2\n?? .conduct/pr-reports/21nco-super-functions-pr-116-20260821-223157.md\n?? .conduct/pr-reports/21nco-super-functions-pr-116-comments.json\n?? superconsole/.conduct/\norigin\thttps://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.git (fetch)\norigin\thttps://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.git (push)\nsf-next\thttps://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next.git (fetch)\nsf-next\thttps://github.com/21nCo/super-functions.next.git (push)\nf39e43cd6ae4bf2382c674bdd145a1f7349ebf2b\nf39e43cd6ae4bf2382c674bdd145a1f7349ebf2b\nf39e43cd6ae4bf2382c674bdd145a1f7349ebf2b\n2026-08-26T16:58:09+05:30\n{\"baseRefName\":\"dev\",\"headRefName\":\"SFNS-2\",\"headRefOid\":\"f39e