-08-08T08-57-24-019fdf69-3e4b-7470-9b1f-a9a74219509f.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-08T04:24:26+00:00, thread_id=019fdf69-3e4b-7470-9b1f-a9a74219509f, security-focused findings and publication verification)\n2503:## Task 6: Rebase, publish, and merge UiFn PR #37, success\n2513:## Task 5: Read-only live UiFn, shadcn, and Coss catalog comparability audit, success\n2520:- UiFn, shadcn/ui, Coss UI, 7.4/10, 8.0/10, drop-in/API compatibility, 69 components, openComponentPartRecipe, `Open calendar`, Coss snapshot\n2576:- The August 11 live comparison found UiFn↔shadcn 7.4/10, UiFn↔Coss 8.0/10, but drop-in/API compatibility only 3–4/10; inventories were UiFn 69, shadcn 64, Coss 54. These are comparability ratings, not readiness/accessibility certification. Re-query Coss because the checked-in snapshot had 45 entries and only 35 exact names remained. [Task 5]\n2577:- UiFn supports React, Svelte, and Solid, with source/package installation and wrappers using `openComponentPartRecipe`, `unstyled`, `classes`, and `styles`. Base Table does not itself implement sorting/filtering/pagination/selection/virtualization even when a demo composes them. [Task 5]\n2579:- For a source branch substantially behind `sf-next/next`, replay/rebase from a clean target worktree before publishing. For `next` PRs, keep `.conduct`; resolve manifest conflicts by preserving UiFn plus incoming MCPFn/MailFn workspaces, then regenerate `package-lock.json` from final manifests. PR #37 merged normally at `8dddd865`. [Task 6]\n2587:- Symptom: screenshot capture times out or a visible-text selector misses an interactive control. Fix: use targeted DOM/accessibility snapshots and inspect the accessible tree (the calendar control was `Open calendar`) before retrying. Do not promote UiFn-owned green verifier output to external pixel parity or independent accessibility evidence. [Task 5]\n3712:# Task Group: superfunctions-dev dirty-worktree provenance in /Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/superfunctions-dev\n3714:applies_to: